Package: sGSVD
Title: The (Group) Sparse Generalized Singular Value Decomposition
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        "Vincent",
        "Guillemot",
        role = c("aut","cre"),
        email = "contact@vincentguillemot.fr"))
Description: Provides sparse and group-sparse variants of the generalized
    eigenvalue decomposition, the generalized singular value decomposition
    (SVD), and the partial least squares SVD, via an alternating least
    squares algorithm with projections onto L1, L1-L2, and group-L1-L2
    constraints. The package mimics the structure of Beaton, Fatt, and
    Abdi's (2014) 'GSVD' package, adding sparsity constraints to the
    resulting pseudo-singular/eigen vectors.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/vguillemot/sGSVD
BugReports: https://github.com/vguillemot/sGSVD/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
